/P 115 0 R
/E (A leading Retail company face challenges in understanding customer shopping behaviour due to the large amount of data generated from different purchasing channels. Changes in customer preferences, product demand, and purchasing patterns make it difficult for businesses to identify the factors that influence consumer decisions and sales performance.Additionally, variations in demographics, product categories, and sales channels \(online and offline\) create complexity in analyzing customer behaviour. Factors such as discounts, product reviews, seasonal trends, and payment preferences may significantly impact purchasing decisions and repeat purchases, but these relationships are not clearly understood.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
