/S /P
/P 124 0 R
/E (The customer behaviour analysis system can be enhanced by integrating additional data sources such as customer feedback, website interaction data, and social media insights. Including these sources can provide a deeper understanding of customer preferences and purchasing behaviour. The system can also be expanded to analyze data from multiple stores, regions, or time periods, enabling businesses to gain broader insights into customer trends and market demand.Additionally, advanced analytics and machine learning techniques can be incorporated to predict customer purchasing patterns, identify potential repeat buyers, and detect customer churn. Implementing real-time data processing and automated analytics can further improve the system by providing instant insights and helping businesses make faster, data-driven decisions to improve marketing strategies and customer engagement.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [2]
>>
