/Title (4.Insight Identification       Identify key factors influencing customer purchasing decisions, such as discounts, review ratings, payment preferences, and seasonal demand. These insights help understand what drives sales and repeat purchases. 5.Data Visualization and Dashboard Creation      Create interactive dashboards using Microsoft Power BI to visualize insights through charts, graphs, and key performance indicators, enabling clear interpretation of customer behaviour and supporting data-driven decision making.)
